<% layout("./layout") %>
<h1>Set up memory-anywhere</h1>
<section id="step-1">
  <p>Add a passkey: your phone, a password manager, Windows Hello or a security key.</p>
  <button id="add-1" type="button">Add first passkey</button>
</section>
<section id="step-2" hidden>
  <p>Add a second passkey kept somewhere else, so losing one never locks you out. A security key or this computer's Windows Hello works; a second synced passkey must come from another provider.</p>
  <p class="muted">Do not keep both in the Google account you use for Gemini.</p>
  <label><input id="different" type="checkbox"> The two passkeys are with different providers</label>
  <button id="add-2" type="button">Add second passkey</button>
</section>
<section id="step-3" hidden>
  <p>Recovery codes. Save them now: they are shown once.</p>
  <ol id="codes" class="code"></ol>
  <label for="confirm-code">Type one of them</label>
  <input id="confirm-code" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false">
  <button id="confirm" type="button">Finish</button>
</section>
<p id="msg" role="status"></p>
